Q: How many people work at the Columbus depot?
   ABSTAINED   sources: 01-newsletter-two-column.md, 02-rotated-table.md, 04-header-footer-noise.md, 06-scanned-source.md
   The documents I have do not answer that. Missing: The excerpts do not state the number of people employed at the Columbus depot; they only mention its storage capacity, utilisation, a closure notice, and a goods received note.

The second and third questions are identical. The only difference is a metadata
filter, and it is the difference between a refusal and a right one.

Without it, retrieval returns the Summary section of eight other quarters —
they are all worded the same way — and Clarity correctly reports that it cannot
answer. The abstention gate turned a silent wrong answer into a visible gap.

Chapter 14 is about not needing the filter to be supplied by hand.
